  decl_reserved_err_type.pcpp - break step of decl_reserved.pcpp:
  a type named pcpp_t (SM0017)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_reserved_err_type.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_reserved_err_type.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
